{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34277","headline":"句曲山朝真词二首 迎真 · 陆龟蒙","name":"句曲山朝真词二首 迎真","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九华磬荅寒泉急，十绝幡摇翠微湿。\n司命旍旌未下来，焚香抱简凝神立。\n残星下照霓襟冷，缺月才分鹤轮影。\n空洞灵章发一声，春来万壑烟花醒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34277.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34277","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}